<blockquote>
<p>It is worth noting that SCP-507 is allowed a computer with an Internet connection in its room… This is a result of SCP-507s persistently clean record, and the implication that if SCP-507 was ever going to be a security leak it would have used its faux-teleportation powers to do so already.</p>
</blockquote>
